## 7. External corroboration (console constraints)

- Xbox UWP graphics: Direct3D only — D3D11 FL10.0/11.0 and D3D12 FL11.0 + SM 6.4, no Agility SDK on console (`walbourn.github.io/directx-and-uwp-on-xbox-one/`).
- Xbox Dev Mode UWP memory ceiling: 5,120 MiB unified RAM+VRAM in Game resource mode (`JulianDr14/jadyx`, `PrismFox67/Eden-UWP` docs; WindowsForum coverage).
- mingw-w64 cannot build the app package for UWP (MSVC `store` libs required; mingw only ships `winstorecompat`/`windowsappcompat` stubs) — mingw-w64-public mailing list, 2025.
